 "text": "Hey there, how are you? That's a common feeling. Lots of people start without much skill. How old are you? Start with simple shapes like lines and boxes. Spend ten minutes every day drawing them. Rough is fine at first. Rough means not perfectly neat. Rough drawing is great practice because you focus on ideas over technique. Stick figures are great because they' simple to draw and look like something human. Spend few minutes each day making them come to life, giving them expressions and clothing.",
